---
import Heading from '../elements/Heading.astro';
---

<div class="related-content">
  <Heading as="h3" size="lg">Das könnte Sie auch interessieren</Heading>
  <div class="related-content__grid">
    <a href="#" class="related-card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532629345422-7515f3d16bb6?w=200&h=200&fit=crop" alt="Altersvorsorge" class="related-card__image">
      <div>
        <p class="related-card__category">Altersvorsorge</p>
        <h4 class="related-card__title">Rentenlücke berechnen: So viel fehlt Ihnen wirklich</h4>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="related-card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?w=200&h=200&fit=crop" alt="Krankenversicherung" class="related-card__image">
      <div>
        <p class="related-card__category">Krankenversicherung</p>
        <h4 class="related-card__title">PKV vs. GKV: Welche Versicherung passt zu Ihnen?</h4>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  /* Related Content */
  .related-content {
    margin: 3rem 1.5rem;
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-warm);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  .related-content :global(.heading) {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .related-content__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .related-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .related-card:hover { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .related-card__image {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 5rem;
    height: 5rem;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
  .related-card__category {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-semibold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .related-card__title {
    font-weight: var(--font-semibold);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .related-content__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
